      "meaning": "从一群人中请某人发言或回答",
      "usageNote": "call on sb；这里的“点名”是请人回答，不是清点人数。",
      "examples": [
        {
          "id": "s1-e1",
          "senseId": "s1",
          "en": "The teacher called on her to answer.",
          "zh": "老师点她回答问题。"
        },
        {
          "id": "s1-e2",
          "senseId": "s1",
          "en": "He raised his hand, but the teacher did not call on him.",
          "zh": "他举了手，但老师没有请他发言。"
        }
      ],
